    {
      "uid": "zhcn:409ab8930286873bda93886f",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "微笑着的旺紫丁脸上，看不到一丝失望和焦躁。\n如果这不是虚张声势的话……那这忍耐力还真是惊人。",
      "source_fingerprint": "963a86d684473fbe74fada9a25dc73241d63c8f7cecec1550ffe827e7803d8e2",
