    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:44b74ebba6a9aa56c0827ba4",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "……什么忙也没帮上。哪怕是只有一点点也好，只要是我能做到的事情……\n我绞尽脑汁、想了又想，最后憋出来的一句话是——",
      "source_fingerprint": "2e3e010d0b905c132a4a8c4636be57e483ccb6f3a1b2678279e9cdb05cc24568",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1130/storytimeline_041130002.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        24,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/24/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d0cb3736b3742254ab145919",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "…………什么都没，Night。呼噜呼噜zZ",
      "source_fingerprint": "16510dfe96bfba2ad11ce43af852ddc688309756b19373c1339aeed53cd5c23f",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1130/storytimeline_041130002.json",
