    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3b22b9569bf40edcad3c8313",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "……。\n呵呵，训练员您还真是个幽默的人呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e37187cf97459a0301f9fdb373fc4473921bbe3f9d2ce7464d1f2f073d11f9fb",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1130/storytimeline_041130002.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        27,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/27/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:00b5999feedba84d3da7f4f2",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "旺紫丁那温柔的微笑，让我的心里感到一阵痛苦……。\n就算再怎么想帮忙，也不该去做自己不擅长的事情啊。",
      "source_fingerprint": "75528c717fac76394014d88fffafcc5ab157000548e512e1eda94d43a08e13a7",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1130/storytimeline_041130002.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        28,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/28/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fb470bdcbdd1b76efeff42ed",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "……下次，我可以靠得更近一些看吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "4e8ad7fbc13d9cc2ebcffa6e00677a6418b9f98351026e150b8e3467b8e80aa5",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
