    {
      "uid": "zhcn:88a8bdd90d9c16eb8f4f8aa2",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "如果真的想成为她的助力……自己能做的事情只有一件。\n那就是——在把作为训练员的工作做到极致之后才能发现的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "628c9057c219508bcce83a55ded213fe92f1482c36d4cbb58393292050f2b888",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1130/storytimeline_041130002.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        29,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/29/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e4fe21c416102c27955b0eaf",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "（再怎么看，这也只能认为是经验的差距了）",
      "source_fingerprint": "c394d0f7578e73fa41ff60c5d7ce414400337869241de3032af6a9a6e0b2882c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1130/storytimeline_041130002.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        3,
        "choice_data_list",
        0
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/3/choice_data_list/0"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:09c12dcbca438f2fcc43a4db",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "越是仔细观察就越能发现……她的完成度相当之高。凭借能忍耐到\n关键时刻的极强耐心作为魅力，她能够展现出优等生般的跑姿。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b4d5e2ca859e35bf62bc38e6a1846c18e2278ddc05e31e536f8c73a9d3c4da94",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1130/storytimeline_041130002.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        3,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/3/text"
    },
